":"Turn customer conversations into trackable work.","OneDrive":"Attach and work with OneDrive files inside monday.com.","Power BI":"View and connect Power BI reports.","ZoomInfo":"Enrich leads and company details inside monday.com.","Amazon S3":"Attach files stored in S3 to your work.","Freshdesk":"Keep support tickets connected to your work.","Snowflake":"Bring selected Snowflake data into monday.com.","Confluence":"Link documentation to related work in monday.com.","Databricks":"Track Databricks jobs and updates.","Jira Cloud":"Track Jira issues and updates alongside your work.","QuickBooks":"Sync invoices and financial updates.","Salesforce":"Keep Salesforce records aligned with your work.","SharePoint":"Access and attach SharePoint files to items.","Smartsheet":"Reflect Smartsheet rows and updates.","Google Chat":"Send monday.com updates directly to Google Chat.","Google Drive":"Attach and manage Google Drive files in items.","Microsoft Team":"Receive updates and notifications inside Microsoft Teams.","Google Calendar":"Create and update calendar events from items.","Active Directory":"Sync user information with your account.","Jira Data Center":"Align development work and business teams.","Outlook Calendar":"Sync meetings with items to keep schedules aligned.","Toggl Integration":"Sync time tracking updates with your work.","Copper Integration":"Keep CRM contacts and deals aligned with monday.com.","Resend Integration":"Send automated emails directly from monday.com workflows.","Stripe Integration":"Track payments and transaction updates.","Twilio Integration":"Send SMS notifications from workflows to your contacts.","Harvest Integration":"Track time entries from Harvest.","Todoist Integration":"Turn Todoist tasks into actionable items.","Basecamp Integration":"Track Basecamp tasks and updates.","Calendly Integration":"Turn booked meetings into trackable work in monday.com.","Typeform Integration":"Create items automatically from new responses.","Bitbucket Int